how's it going everybody it's warren and  welcome back to my channel the cosmic  wonder where we talk about all things  marvel and  everything relating to the marvel  cinematic universe and today we're going  to be talking about a subject that is  kind of sensitive right now to mcu fans  and that is black widow coming out  on video on demand on disney plus we got  a lot of information over the weekend a  lot of reports about disney plus and  whether or not black widow is in fact  going to go to the theaters or go  straight to video on demand on disney  plus  and there's a lot that you need to know  about whether or not this is actually  going to happen  or not including some things that disney  said over the weekend but don't worry in  this video i'm going to break down  everything that you need to know on  whether or not black widow is going to  video on demand or not  but first big congratulations to youtube  user  zv feinberg for being the winner of last  week's  mysterio funko pop just email me in the  email in my description and we'll get  you your prize and for this week's  giveaway  i'm giving away a dr strange funko pop  all you have to do to enter is be  subscribed to my channel  like this video and leave a comment on  the video down below i'll be picking a  winner next monday  so to start off i'm actually one of the  people who would like to see black widow  in the theaters now if theaters don't  open back up and it's a big safety  problem i understand to go into video on  demand and i'll be okay with it but i  would prefer to see it in the theaters  but here's the reality of the situation  there is absolutely  100 a chance that black widow could go  straight to video on demand on disney  plus for  29.99 a few days ago disney in their  earnings report  announced what disney plus is calling  premier access  now premiere access all that is is video  on demand  and with their announcement of their  premiere access they announced the first  movie going to the platform and that is  mulan mulan was a very big project for  disney and a very anticipated film and  was supposed to be a very big film in  the theaters  a lot of people were really looking  forward to it but now it is going  straight to video on demand on disney  plus  so here's how this works because there  seems to be some confusion about this  and here's how it will work for black  widow when they release the movie you  can buy it on premiere access for  29.99 but this is not a one-time watch  you own the movie on your disney plus  account and disney further explained  this  and this is how it will work for black  widow so i'll replace the word mulan  with black widow  once you have premier access to black  widow you can watch the film as many  times as you want on any platform where  disney plus is available  your access to mulan will continue as  long as you are an active disney plus  subscriber  so there you have it if black widow  comes out on video on demand on premiere  access  then as long as you're a disney plus  subscriber and you buy the movie you  will have it forever but of course the  big question is  is black widow coming out on premiere  access and right now the answer is  probably not a guaranteed yes but it  probably is going to come out on disney  plus premier access  and here's the reason why disney didn't  just make premiere access  only for mulan this is a business model  for disney plus to introduce  movies straight to video on demand  rather than theaters now obviously films  would make  more money if they were in theaters but  disney has a plan they specifically said  that they're going to watch mulan and if  it does well consider doing it for other  movies however we have learned some new  information over the weekend and it  seems like disney has already begun to  prepare for  other movies to be released over the  weekend the guys at murphy's  multiverse.com have discovered that  disney actually has plans to release  more films on disney's premiere access  soon while asking customer service about  mulan and other things coming to  premiere access here's what they had to  say  the disney rep said as per checking in  our data that the 29.99 is on top of  your yearly subscription  and your premier access for now we have  the mulan but  when the time goes by the premiere  access will be more updated and more  movies to watch  they went on to ask more questions and  the rep said as of now there is no  announcement yet for the list of movies  but  we guarantee you that disney plus will  offer you  more amazing movies so somebody at  disney plus in customer service  said that more movies are going to be  coming to premiere access  so clearly this is not just a one-time  thing with mulan  disney has plans to make this a full  service meaning  disney is 100 considering releasing  black widow on premiere access on disney  plus  and here's how they'll make their  decision right now the reopening for  major movie theater chains have been  pushed back and been pushed back over  and over again  and right now we basically have about  three months until black widow is  supposed to be released in theaters  now if we go another couple of months  and the theaters are not opened yet they  will push black  widow back again because disney won't  want black widow to be one of the first  films to premiere when the theaters  first  open they're going to want the theater  to be open for a little bit because when  they reopen a lot of people probably  aren't going to go at first even to see  black widow  they'd make a lot more money if they  actually put it on premier access  so if they push back black widow again  one more time  and theaters aren't expected to open  until next  year middle of next year they will most  likely make the decision to put black  widow on premier access on disney plus  because we love disney and we love  marvel but they are companies and they  need to make money and right now they  are losing a ton of money by just  sitting on black widow and if theaters  aren't going to open until another year  they will definitely  put black widow on premiere access this  way people can buy the movie  and not to mention they'll get money for  people signing up for disney plus  just to buy the movie and then of course  all the merchandising that comes with  that and right now disney is really  struggling with their parks being closed  for the most part and no movies coming  out so it really all comes down to when  the theaters are reopening and right now  it's said that they're not going to be  opening up again until middle of next  year meaning  the possibilities for black widow coming  out on premiere access  on disney plus are very very high so  stay tuned because the closer we get to  black widow's release date the more  we're going to know about it going to  theaters or  premiere access but again down below let  me know what you think about this would  you rather it go into theaters or would  you rather it go to premiere access if  theaters open this year  will you be going to see the film let me  know what you think in the comments down  below don't forget to like the video and  subscribe so you don't miss out on any  of the latest  mcu news for live updates you can follow  me on twitter and instagram and as  always thank you all so much for  watching  woof

